    {
      "id": "skarn_ruvo_coal_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "Ruvo does not answer for a while, and works. “It does,” he says eventually. “Goes down cold in the basket. Comes up you can feel it through the wicker.” The hammer goes down. “I said so once, in the Drift, in front of eleven people. Nobody argued and nobody looked at me and the subject changed. I have not said it since. You are the first.”"
        }
      ],
